  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  archives: {fileID: 0}
  isNew: 1
  isOpen: 0
  title: Asteroid, alien intelligence, or an approaching apocalypse?
  body: "For several decades now, scientists have been asking themselves: where does
    the beta signal come from? The Galactic Academy of Sciences first detected it
    34 years ago, yet we still know almost nothing about it. Scientists report that
    the beta signal intensifies from March to April and almost disappears in the
    autumn. This happens every year.\\n A survey at the Academy showed that most
    scientists believe it is a planet. However, the Academy\u2019s students say it
    is most likely Slenderman. What do you think?\\n "
